DTSTAMP:20261122T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T103000
DTEND:20261126T104000
SUMMARY:Turkey out of fridge + Sauté stuffing vegetables
DESCRIPTION:• Take the turkey and the herb butter out of the fridge\, s
 o the bird loses its chill and the butter softens.\n• Melt 1 stick but
 ter in the large skillet. Cook 2 onions and 4 celery stalks\, diced\, un
 til soft\, about 10 min. Add 3 cloves minced garlic for the last minute\
 , then take it off the heat.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Turkey out of fridge + Sauté stuffing vegetables
TRIGGER:PT0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tg26-thu-1@aajbaker.com
DTSTAMP:20261122T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T110000
DTEND:20261126T111000
SUMMARY:Preheat oven to 450°F + Veg in the sheet pan + Trim sprouts
DESCRIPTION:• Preheat the oven to 450°F with racks in the lower-middle
  and bottom positions.\n• Scatter 1 chopped onion\, 2 carrots and 2 ce
 lery stalks in the sheet pan under the rack\, and pour in 1 cup water so
  the drippings don’t scorch.\n• Trim and halve 2 lb Brussels sprouts
  while you’re chopping. They can sit on the counter until they go in t
 he oven.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Preheat oven to 450°F + Veg in the sheet pan + Trim sprouts
TRIGGER:PT0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
