BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tg26-thu-4@aajbaker.com
DTSTAMP:20261122T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T115000
DTEND:20261126T120000
SUMMARY:Assemble stuffing
DESCRIPTION:• Butter the 9 × 13 dish. In a big bowl\, toss the bread c
 ubes with the sautéed vegetables\, 2 tbsp chopped sage\, 1 tbsp thyme\,
  ¼ cup parsley\, about 1 tsp kosher salt and pepper. Taste for salt now
 \, before the eggs go in. Add 2 eggs\, beaten\, and 2–3 cups vegetable
  stock\, tossing until moist but not soggy. Pack it into the dish and co
 ver with foil.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Assemble stuffing
TRIGGER:PT0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
