DESCRIPTION:• Peel the potatoes and cut them into 2-inch chunks. Drop t
 hem into the potato pot as you go and cover them with cold water.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
