DTEND:20261126T123500
SUMMARY:Rotate the turkey
DESCRIPTION:• Turn the pan front to back so the turkey browns evenly. I
 f the pan looks dry\, add another ½ cup water.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.
 com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
