BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tg26-thu-7@aajbaker.com
DTSTAMP:20261122T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T123000
DTEND:20261126T124000
SUMMARY:Stuffing in + Rewarm turkey gravy + Rewarm mushroom gravy
DESCRIPTION:• Stuffing in on the bottom rack\, covered with foil.\n• 
 Rewarm the turkey gravy on low in its own saucepan. It will have set lik
 e jelly\, so whisk as it melts. Stir now and then\, and add a splash of 
 the saved stock if it gets too thick.\n• Rewarm the mushroom gravy on 
 low in its own saucepan.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Stuffing in + Rewarm turkey gravy + Rewarm mushroom gravy
TRIGGER:PT0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
