SUMMARY:Start checking turkey temp + Potatoes on
DESCRIPTION:• Start checking the turkey temperature: breast 150°F\, th
 ighs 165°F or higher.\n• Salt the potato water and bring it to a boil
 \, then simmer about 20 min until tender.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/th
 anksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
