SUMMARY:🦃 Turkey out to rest
DESCRIPTION:• Turkey out when the breast reads 150°F and the thighs re
 ad 165°F or higher. Move it to a cutting board and rest it uncovered fo
 r 25–30 min.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
