BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tg26-thu-11@aajbaker.com
DTSTAMP:20261122T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T131000
DTEND:20261126T132000
SUMMARY:Drippings into turkey gravy + Check mushroom gravy
DESCRIPTION:• Pour everything in the turkey pan through a strainer into
  a bowl. Press hard on the vegetables to squeeze out their juices\, then
  throw them away. Skim off the fat and taste the juices\, since dry-brin
 e drippings are salty. Whisk them into the turkey gravy only\, simmer\, 
 and season with pepper\, plus salt only if it needs it.\n• Thin the mu
 shroom gravy with a splash of vegetable stock if needed.\n\nhttps://www.
 aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Drippings into turkey gravy + Check mushroom gravy
TRIGGER:PT0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tg26-thu-12@aajbaker.com
DTSTAMP:20261122T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T131500
DTEND:20261126T132500
SUMMARY:Stuffing out + Sprouts in
DESCRIPTION:• Take the stuffing out (165°F in the center) and tent it 
 loosely with foil to keep warm.\n• Toss the sprouts with about 3 tbsp 
 olive oil\, 1 tsp kosher salt and pepper. Spread them on the second shee
 t pan (not the turkey’s) cut side down in one layer. Roast without sti
 rring until the cut sides are deep brown\, about 20 min.\n\nhttps://www.
 aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Stuffing out + Sprouts in
TRIGGER:PT0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
