UID:tg26-thu-13@aajbaker.com
DTSTAMP:20261122T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T132000
DTEND:20261126T133000
SUMMARY:Mash potatoes
DESCRIPTION:• Drain the potatoes. Mash them with 1½ sticks butter and 
 about 1½ cups warm milk\, and season. Keep covered on low or in a slow 
 cooker.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Mash potatoes
TRIGGER:PT0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tg26-thu-14@aajbaker.com
DTSTAMP:20261122T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T133000
DTEND:20261126T134000
SUMMARY:Carve the turkey + Cranberry sauce out
DESCRIPTION:• Carve the turkey. Cut off each leg at the joint and split
  it into drumstick and thigh. Slice each breast off whole along the brea
 stbone\, then cut it across the grain into ½-inch slices. Take off the 
 wings and arrange everything on a warm platter.\n• Take the cranberry 
 sauce out of the fridge.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Carve the turkey + Cranberry sauce out
TRIGGER:PT0S
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
