SUMMARY:Finish sprouts + Fill serving dishes
DESCRIPTION:• Toss the sprouts with 1–2 tbsp balsamic or maple syrup\
 , or the juice of ½ lemon. Taste for salt.\n• Fill the serving dishes
 \, giving each gravy its own ladle and label.\n\nhttps://www.aajbaker.co
 m/thanksgiving/
URL:https://www.aajbaker.com/thanksgiving/
